 "notes": "Dissolved 'Other underwear' (k73): bras to Bra, Jockey/Munsingwear/aussieBum to Men's underwear, Mey/Jockey Singleton/Zimmerli to Undershirt, Stanfield's to Thermal base layer. Merged Tights + Stockings. Dropped: duplicate Cabot Hosiery Mills socks (same models as Darn Tough), Jockey 'Kenosha Klosed Krotch' (historic), Empreinte model dump trimmed to two plus one range, Cake Maternity cut to one nursing bra, generic cut names moved to t. Not added (no retrieved page confirming): Maidenform bra archetype (page names no model), Spanx/Skims archetypes, Wolford Neon 40/Falke Pure Matt specifics, Burlington argyle link, Devold, Knix/Björn Borg brand entries (no page retrieved), Orchard Corset/What Katie Did/Dark Garden brand entries. Bonds singlet dated 1940 per the Chesty Bond page (brief said 1938). Pretty Polly and Aristoc ceased trading May 2026. No traditions on this shelf."
